Also the flat-measurement guard's PURPOSE: reject a measurement where doubling doesn't show. min-based ratios still show real growth when the clock is honest. ✓.

Edge — could min-of-5 make ratio too LOW (false pass of a real regression)? A real quadratic: every doubled run takes ~4x regardless → min ~4x → trips. ✓.

